%% Logistics OS - Predictive ETA serving path with latency budget
%% Rendering: Mermaid sequenceDiagram. See docs/intelligence/predictive-eta.md
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as Visibility/milestone
  participant BUS as Kafka
  participant SVC as ETA service
  participant FEAT as Online feature store
  participant MODEL as ETA model (quantile GBT)
  participant SELL as Feature snapshot store
  participant ORCH as Orchestration (L5)
  participant FB as Feedback (POD/milestones)

  V->>BUS: vis.milestone.events.v1 / obs.telemetry.v1
  BUS->>SVC: event (shipmentId, leg)
  Note over SVC: T+0
  SVC->>FEAT: get features (p99 < 20 ms)
  FEAT-->>SVC: feature vector (featuresHash)
  SVC->>MODEL: score quantiles P10/P50/P90 (p99 < 30 ms)
  MODEL-->>SVC: prediction
  SVC->>SELL: persist prediction + feature snapshot
  SVC->>BUS: intel.prediction.v1 (p99 total < 50 ms)
  BUS->>ORCH: signal for decision
  Note over SVC: refresh on each milestone/ping
  FB->>BUS: tms.shipment.delivered (actual)
  BUS->>SVC: outcome
  SVC->>SELL: emit intel.feedback.v1 (label)
